cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Mnemosyne in your research or software, please cite it as below."
title: "Mnemosyne: a multi-tenant cognitive memory layer for AI agents"
abstract: >-
  Mnemosyne is a bitemporal, provider-agnostic, RLS-isolated memory layer for
  AI agents, offering hybrid recall (Postgres full-text and dense vectors with
  graph context and an optional rerank) over Postgres and pgvector, consumable
  through an HTTP API, an MCP server, a CLI and typed SDKs.
type: software
authors:
